{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936620/extras/79148cec32f87bcaff7109af3783204d.avif?t=1774181654\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936620/extras_big/79148cec32f87bcaff7109af3783204d.avif?t=1774181654 width=1600 height=758 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diary of Summer Travel is a lighthearted BL-themed visual novel featuring furry characters, romance, and comedy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one ordinary summer night, the protagonist (the Player) \u2014 a young college student \u2014 suddenly finds himself transported into an unfamiliar town inhabited by beastmen. What was supposed to be a normal summer vacation soon turns into an unforgettable journey filled with laughter, encounters, and unexpected bonds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic visual novel structure: read through branching storylines and enjoy rich dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance system: build relationships with different characters by raising their affection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple routes and endings depending on your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of lighthearted comedy and romantic moments to balance the story tone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character art and CG illustrations created by Luken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short yet complete story, perfect for a relaxing play session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furry BL theme with a warm, slice-of-life atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy furry characters, romance, and charming everyday stories, Diary of Summer Travel will bring you a refreshing summer adventure.</p>","background":"http